 ## 业务读模型
 
 Store = {id,name,address,phone,notice,isOpen:boolean,serviceModes:('DINE_IN'|'PICKUP'|'DELIVERY')[],pickupMinutes:number,deliveryFeeFen:number,minOrderFen:number,themeColor:string}。
